# Empty means "same origin" — the Vite dev server proxies /v1 to the backend
# (vite.config.ts), which is what keeps CORS out of the picture. Set an absolute URL only
# when the frontend is served from a different origin than the backend; that additionally
# requires CORS on the backend and SameSite=None on the session cookie (API_계약.md 8.3절).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
